              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gus 23:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuntu wese afise agasembga ntaz’ anyīgire hafi: ar’ impumyi, ar’ ūcumbagira, ar’ ūfise izuru rihomberanye, ar’ ūfise urugingo rurutana n’urundi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ar’ ūvunitse ikirenge cank’ igikonjo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ar’ ūfise inyonzo, ar’ uwabaye impfunya, ar’ ūfise agasembga ku jisho, ar’ ūfise amahere cank’ urukemba, ar’ ūmenetse amavya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ntihaze hagire umuntu n’umwe wo mu ruvyaro rwa Aroni azokwigera yīgira hafi afise agasembga, ngw ahēreze ibimazi vyanje, jewe Uhoraho, bitōngōrwa n’umuriro: kw azoba arikw agasembga, ntaze yigire hafi ngw ahēreze imfungurwa zanje, jewe Imana yiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:22"
