              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ashobora kurya ku mfungurwa zanje, Imana yiwe, ari ku zera cane, canke ku zera zindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mugabo ntaze yēgēre ca gihuzu gikingīra Ahēra cane, canke ngo yēgēre igicaniro, kukw azoba afise agasembga, kugira ngo yoye guhumanya ahēra hanje ah’ ari ho hose: kukw ari jewe Uhoraho ndabeza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
